      "machineHash": "99488846e887946e7161f76eb7e94ae13b1f3545c4efc9f438cc6ac4261717bc",
      "machineText": "这种简单的架构让 JavaScript 代码可以直接调用 Go 函数（通过自动生成的绑定），同时 Go 也可以将事件和数据发回前端。两个层通过高效的内存桥接进行通信，开销低于一毫秒。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "This simple architecture enables JavaScript code to call Go functions directly (through auto-generat…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
